// The first-person kit: the arms, the hands, and what they hold, built of boxes in the
// hand's own space, metres. Every scene carries one of each, drawn only in first person
// and placed each frame by the view model (crates/render/src/viewmodel.rs).
//
// A held thing's space: its grip at the origin, along +Y, its face toward -Z.
// An arm's space: the wrist at the origin, the elbow toward +Z.
// An open hand's space: the wrist at the origin, the fingers toward -Z, the palm down.
// `string` is a unit length along +Y, stretched by its placing; so are the arrows.
